WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:05,580
In the past few days since I got married, I have never heard anyone mention this old lady. I thought she was gone.

2
00:00:05,580 --> 00:00:08,680
I don't think it will arrive in another three to five days.

3
00:00:08,680 --> 00:00:12,580
The old lady has always been partial to three-bedroom apartments and is picky about big ones.

4
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:15,780
Now that your leg is injured, he's afraid he's going to cause trouble again

5
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:17,880
Save it, what are your plans?

6
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:20,680
Don't worry, mother, I know it well

7
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:24,340
Yu'er, I'm thinking of hosting a factory banquet in two days.

8
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:28,940
So that you can recognize the person, so as not to embarrass you when the old lady comes back to pick out gifts.

9
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:31,540
What my mother said is, I will be ready when I turn around

10
00:00:31,540 --> 00:00:36,520
Is grandma not easy to get along with?

11
00:00:36,520 --> 00:00:44,210
She just doesn't like me very much. When I was a teenager, it was the time when my uncle should start a career.

12
00:00:44,210 --> 00:00:49,210
But when others mentioned Pingninghou Mansion, they always said that I had never forgotten my mother's studies, so she was released from prison.
